      "value": "<p><em>Overlay (midi-qol):</em> once a turn, when the ranger's use damages a creature marked by their Hunter's Mark, they are offered the mark's extra damage against a different creature within 30 feet of it (the feature's Hunter's Mark Damage activity). It changes no item: midi applies it to any item with the identifier <code>superior-hunters-prey</code> (2024 rules) that nothing else automates.</p>"
    },
